OL,3,GNEWSABritish adventurer Karl Bushby
OL,4,Acompletes 28-year journey
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish adventurer Karl Bushby has
OL,7,Fcompleted his 31,000-mile (50,000 km)
OL,8,Fjourney from South America to Hull in
OL,9,Fthe UK, reuniting with his mother at
OL,10,Fthe family home 28 years after setting
OL,11,Foff.
OL,13,FIn November 1998, the former
OL,14,Fparatrooper, then aged 29, set off from
OL,15,FPunta Arenas, Chile, to complete an
OL,16,Funbroken path back home, without
OL,17,Fbreaking two self-imposed rules: not to
OL,18,Freturn to the UK until the end of the
OL,19,Fjourney, and not to use transport to
OL,20,Fadvance.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
