OL,3,GNEWSABritish adventurer Karl Bushby
OL,4,Acompletes 28-year journey
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, crowds gathered in Hull's city
OL,7,Fcentre to welcome Bushby, before he set
OL,8,Foff to complete the final few miles
OL,9,Fhome to his mother Angela Bushby.
OL,11,FReaching the front door, he said: "It's
OL,12,Fgood to be home. It feels surreal."
